:: ChildhoodChores [childhood]
# Daily Tasks

<div class="season-indicator season-<<print $environment.season>>">
  <<print $environment.season.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.season.slice(1)>> • 
  <<print $environment.weather.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.weather.slice(1)>>
</div>

Even as a child, you have responsibilities within the tribe. Everyone must contribute according to their abilities, and learning these tasks is an important part of growing up.

What would you like to help with today?

<<link "Gather firewood with the other children">>
  <<set $skills.strength += 0.2>>
  <<goto "GatherFirewood">>
<</link>>

<<link "Help prepare food with the women">>
  <<set $skills.foraging += 0.2>>
  <<goto "PrepareFood">>
<</link>>

<<link "Learn to make simple tools">>
  <<set $skills.toolMaking += 0.2>>
  <<goto "MakeSimpleTools">>
<</link>>

:: ChildhoodPlay [childhood]
